  "body": "The 8799 entity for a question mark over an equal sign seems to have changed in appearance in the last few months. Whereas the question mark was easily readable before, it is now nearly impossible to make out as a question mark. This seems to be a universal display issue across browsers.\r\n![ckequal](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/55895121/65795244-d258da00-e137-11e9-8bff-885e24c491ed.png)\r\n",
